[PrintTextModified Text:我到画室看了看，<br>发现诺亚跟安安坐在桌边。|#0203Adv06_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们两个都正埋头干活。<br>诺亚嘴里边哼着歌边画画，而安安——|#0203Adv06_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:呣唔唔……|#0203Adv06_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:则是神情严峻地盯着一大沓纸。|#0203Adv06_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，还行不？<br>想到什么能让主角大展身手的情节了吗？|#0203Adv06_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms02_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『此刻吾辈正在等待天启降临』|#0203Adv06_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:那就是说，还没想到？|#0203Adv06_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……|#0203Adv06_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚不经意的一句话，让安安发出烦恼的声音。|#0203Adv06_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这一刻，她们两个看起来就像是正在学校上课的同学，<br>场面令人欣慰，但……|#0203Adv06_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms02_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:『这种的怎样？』|#0203Adv06_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安把一张写满文字的纸张<br>塞给诺亚。|#0203Adv06_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我看看……|#0203Adv06_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……女主角怎么在这个地方就死掉，<br>没见过这种的啊。|#0203Adv06_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:粗略看了一遍内容，诺亚语气略带不满地说道。|#0203Adv06_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms02_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01-

[PrintTextModified Text:"『你不觉得，就是这样才够新颖吗？<br>　重要的是，不要被固有框架限制住想像力』|#0203Adv06_AnAn005|" AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『诺亚同为艺术家，肯定能够理解吾辈！』|#0203Adv06_AnAn006| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:话是这么说……<br>可诺亚觉得，有些地方是不能改的。|#0203Adv06_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Cry1,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1-Option-All

[PrintTextModified Text:可恶，果然不行吗……！|#0203Adv06_AnAn007| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 紙をくしゃくしゃに丸める音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_135 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:安安把纸片揉成一团，<br>随手丢弃在地上。|#0203Adv06_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 紙をくしゃくしゃに丸める音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_135 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊，诺亚也画歪了～扔了。|#0203Adv06_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0203Adv06_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:令人欣慰。嗯，欣慰是欣慰……<br>可在我看来，<br>不停地往地上扔纸团，这种行为是不正确的。|#0203Adv06_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我得提醒一下，让她们尽快打扫……）|#0203Adv06_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,ArmR1-Option-All
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不小心连笔也给一起扔了。<br>笔在哪？诺亚，你有没有看到？|#0203Adv06_AnAn008| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯～？在哪里呢？|#0203Adv06_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚四处张望的时候<br>发现了我。|#0203Adv06_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是希罗。<br>希罗，你有没有看到安安的笔？|#0203Adv06_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我才刚来，肯定没看见啊。<br>你们要把身边收拾得更加整洁才行。|#0203Adv06_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，真的，到处都乱糟糟的……|#0203Adv06_Noah009| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:算了。正好我也在找有什么能帮忙的地方。<br>我来帮你们收拾，<br>你们就继续做好自己的工作吧。|#0203Adv06_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嘿嘿，希罗，谢谢你。<br>对了，那个，诺亚我啊……|#0203Adv06_Noah010| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚刚想对我说些什么，<br>却突然尴尬地把话吞了回去。|#0203Adv06_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:还是算了！|#0203Adv06_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么回事？她想跟我说什么……？）|#0203Adv06_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈的笔在哪里……<br>天启快要降临了啊……|#0203Adv06_AnAn009| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在我跟诺亚说话期间，安安一直垂头丧气，<br>眼角挂着泪花，深深叹气。|#0203Adv06_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你的笔就由我来找。<br>暂时先用这个吧。|#0203Adv06_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

