[PrintTextModified Text:"（那时候我们约好了，<br>　要一起在屋顶看烟花）|#0203Adv06_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……可是最终，这个约定没能实现）|#0203Adv06_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:记忆的潮水向我汹涌袭来，把那天的晚霞冲刷得格外清晰。<br>每次我想要深呼吸时，喉咙都会一阵哽咽。|#0203Adv06_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

