[PrintTextModified Text:我紧紧握住拳头，<br>强行把意识拉回现实中来。|#0203Adv06_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:等我找到你的笔，记得把这支钢笔还我。|#0203Adv06_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:跟安安说完，<br>我就开始收拾起散落在地面上的纸张。|#0203Adv06_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:地上有几张软趴趴的纸，看着像泡过水似的。<br>我不由得在意起来。|#0203Adv06_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这软趴趴的纸是怎么回事？|#0203Adv06_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊你说那些？<br>那是诺亚用稀释得很淡的颜料画出来的画哦。|#0203Adv06_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:……原来是这样。|#0203Adv06_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:确实像她说的那样，<br>纸面上能看到一片片淡淡的颜料残渍。|#0203Adv06_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，说实话无法判别到底画的是什么。|#0203Adv06_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是花纹吗？也有一点像吧。<br>　可能这就是所谓艺术吧）|#0203Adv06_Hiro018|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艺术真的很深奥……|#0203Adv06_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我把好几个纸团扔进垃圾桶以后，<br>找到了安安的笔。|#0203Adv06_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看，找到你的笔了。<br>这样你就可以集中精神了吧。|#0203Adv06_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……是啊。|#0203Adv06_AnAn011| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知道为什么，安安一脸不爽，<br>一手把笔给抢走了。|#0203Adv06_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她刚摆出一副要奋笔疾书的样子，<br>就突然抱着头趴在桌上。|#0203Adv06_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

